<title>FRANCE: Rouen Sept 1-18 grain exports at 220,079 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen Sept 1-18 grain exports at 220,079 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exports from Rouen reached 220,079 tonnes between September 1 and September 18, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Grain exports totalled 324,000 tonnes in September 1995.</p>
<p>The 220,079 tonnes total included 216,779 tonnes of wheat and 3,300 tonnes of barley. The barley was destined for Poland.</p>
<p>Wheat destinations break down as follows (in tonnes)</p>
<p>    West Africa				 29,697</p>
<p>    Canary Islands			     3,500</p>
<p>    Cuba					  43,265</p>
<p>    Denmark					1,500</p>
<p>    Georgia				     25,900</p>
<p>    Britain					8,440</p>
<p>    Italy					 47,775</p>
<p>    Morocco					2,500</p>
<p>    Mauritius				   13,500</p>
<p>    Mozambique				  15,000</p>
<p>    Poland					 8,952</p>
<p>    Portugal				     1,750</p>
<p>    Turkey					15,000</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
